{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生の勝又春です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "タイトルにもあるように、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先ほど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生楽曲「We got your back」のMV公開"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "が6月26日22時に決定したことが発表されました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生LIVEではすでに披露しましたが、\nMVを通して、\nよりこの楽曲がみなさんに愛されて、\nみなさんの力になれたら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "幸いです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひご覧ください〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "___"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、日曜日はオンラインミーグリありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobq11EJ5.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobSIOf2U.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobcwB6IJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お気付きの通り、写真を縦に繋げることにハマっています...🫢"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "服はお花畑をイメージして、白いワンピース🤍"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "珍しいね〜ってたくさん言ってもらって"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少し恥ずかしさもありつつ、嬉しかったです☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "次回のオンラインミーグリは6/27☀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今までは、「We got your back」のお話になっても"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVのことは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「チョ　チョ　チョ　チョット待って♪」\n(「各駅停車」風)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "としか言えなかったんだけど、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "次回6/27のミーグリ以降は、MVのお話もできるね！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しい🙌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログでも、また楽曲のことやMVのことお話しさせてください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6/28のリアルミーグリ、リアルサイン会も楽しみです\n気をつけてお越しください♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "___"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふと気になって確認したところ、\n四期生LIVEから今日でちょうど3週間だそうです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はやいねえ、\n今でも寝る前に、写真や映像を見返して余韻に浸ってしまいます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだまだ載せられていない写真がたくさんあるのですが、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はこちらの1枚"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobcGaAqW.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この前、偶然お仕事の待ち時間がこの4人になって\n「標識披露した4人やん〜！」と勝手にエモさを感じていました.。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "エモいですよね...！🤔"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "___"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も読んでくださりありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミーグリの服装のテーマにしたにも関わらず、実は人生でお花畑行ったことないんです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年の夏は行ってみたいな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一緒に行ってくれますか？🌻"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobEQtZTt.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "勝又 春　#40"}], "source": "official"}